   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Virtual Mass Improvement</em></p>\n<p>When you have your mass increased, you can spend 3 Cursed Energy once per round to replace one of your attacks by kicking or throwing an object with massive strength. This creates a 5 foot wide, 60 feet long line, causing all creatures within range to make a Dexterity saving throw, taking twice your unarmed strike damage on a failed save. This has the limb damaging effect on a failed save.</p>",
